Package: pdadr
Type: Package
Title: Access and Processing of the PDAD-A 2024 Microdata
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Rodrigo Emmanuel",
                    family = "Santana Borges",
                    role = c("cre","aut","cph"),
                    email = "rodrigo@borges.net.br",
                    comment = "affiliation - Distintive Lab & UnDF")
Description: Functions to access and process the microdata of the 2024
    District Household Sample Survey of the Federal District of Brazil and
    its surrounding area (PDAD-A, 'Pesquisa Distrital por Amostra de
    Domicílios do Distrito Federal e entorno'), published by the Institute
    for Economic Research and Strategy of the Federal District (IPE/DF) at
    <https://pdad.ipe.df.gov.br/>. The package ships a complete metadata
    table (variable and code dictionary) for the household and resident
    databases, along with functions for dictionary queries, labelling of
    coded variables, direct reading of the microdata with local caching,
    weighted estimates and territorial harmonisation with IBGE geographic
    codes (compatible with Census shapefiles and the 'geobr' package).
